                                How long does the empanelment process take?
                            </button>
                        </h2>
                        <div id="collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#accordionFAQ">
                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                If all required documents are correctly submitted, the process typically takes approximately two weeks for provisional empanelment and an additional two weeks for empanelment.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="accordion-item">
                        <h2 class="accordion-header">
                            <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseTwo">
                                Is field verification mandatory for all manufacturers?
                            </button>
                        </h2>
                        <div id="collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordionFAQ">
                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                Yes, field verification is mandatory to ensure that installations at client sites meet all the required standards.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

